 "change": "DEV3 Row: autocommit INSERT executor in A's statement driver (autocommit_insert_live: Row Begin, statement start, the caller's table, insert_statement in a never-inlined sub-frame, C's Commit; a failed statement is rolled back to its mark and finished after the sub-frame returned, then the full rollback and finish_aborted; refusals on the way to the end are fenced, only FlushRequired is continued through Rollback::flush). The commit fits COMMIT 3,024 B (2,889 B) with no C change. A new two-sided F4 contract re-sets ROLLBACK_CALLER 512->1,536, rollback.next 6,144->6,528 and rollback.clr_lane 11,520->12,416 B (C charge 44,304 and cap 65,536 unchanged; C census code unchanged); this is outside the user's decision card (COMMIT) and is flagged for the user in the PR. Tests LAC-A01..A12 (no A08), LAC-J01/J02. Called only by tests.",
